  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOVEO - Youth in Action: Towards Diversity without Violence, Building Partnerships for Peacebuilding and Justice in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Moveo (Latin &#x201C;motus us&#x201D; for &#x201C;movement / moved&#x201D; as it relates to thought and emotion) focuses on human rights protection by addressing recommendations of human rights mechanisms and filling an important research gap related to the situation of LGBTI people in El Salvador. The project establishes common spaces for youth, who have been historically neglected in decision-making, to become main actors and co-responsible for the welfare of the community. It works to ensure peacebuilding, violence prevention, protection and social cohesion, as well as promote youth participation and inclusion through different training, direct interventions and awareness-raising at the local level.</narrative>
  </description>
